# Gev, Scaled Scorch only affects creatures that enter while he is already on the battlefield (the ruling): a creature that enters
# at the same time as Gev gets no counter though an opponent has lost life this turn. In Bot2's turn 4 Bot1 bolts Bot2 in the
# upkeep (an opponent has lost life), Bot2 casts Wrath of God and Gev and Bot1's Ornithopter die, and Bot1 answers with Second
# Sunrise, which returns Gev, the Ornithopter and Black Lotus at once: the Ornithopter enters as a plain 0/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Gev, Scaled Scorch
Ornithopter
Second Sunrise
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Wrath of God
Island x20

